[statement]
As `a-package-losing-a-name-it-provides-is-removed-at-the-turn-of-its-successor`,
with the package the request brings providing the name at no version:
`idf` cannot stand beside `ide`, which holds `id`, and apk removes `ide`
just before installing `idf`. A package providing a name at no version
that the new one holds is not held back so: it goes first
(`an-installed-provider-is-compared-first-bb-cc`).

[repository]
P:ide
V:1
p:id=78

P:idf
V:1
p:id
k:10

P:app
V:1
D:a b idf

P:a
V:1

P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:old
V:1

P:ide
V:1
p:id=78

P:x
V:1
D:id

[world]
x

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove old 1
install a 1
install b 1
remove ide 1
install idf 1
install app 1
